{"id":1478,"date":"2016-06-13T14:02:38","date_gmt":"2016-06-13T14:02:38","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.myjammindjs.com\/?p=1478"},"modified":"2016-06-13T14:02:38","modified_gmt":"2016-06-13T14:02:38","slug":"best-of-2012-award","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/press-release\/best-of-2012-award\/","title":{"rendered":"Best Of 2012 Award"},"content":{"rendered":"<table style=\"width: 124px;\" width=\"124\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 0 !important; margin: 0 !important;\" valign=\"bottom\" width=\"130\"><a style=\"padding: 0 !important; margin: 0 !important;\" title=\"Weddings, Wedding Venues\" href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingwire.com?utm_source=BCA%2BBadge&amp;utm_medium=Badge&amp;utm_campaign=BCA%2BBadge\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter\" style=\"display: block !important; padding: 0 !important; border: none !important; margin: 0 !important;\" src=\"http:\/\/static.weddingwire.com\/static\/images\/badges\/BCA-2012\/BCA_2012-badge-top.png\" alt=\"Weddings, Wedding Venues\" border=\"0\" \/><\/a><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 0 !important; margin: 0 !important;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"130\"><a style=\"padding: 0 !important; margin: 0 !important;\" title=\"2012 Bride's Choice Awards | Best Wedding Photographers, Wedding Dresses, Wedding Cakes, Wedding Florists, Wedding Planners\" href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingwire.com\/brides-choice-awards?utm_source=BCA%2BBadge&amp;utm_medium=Badge&amp;utm_campaign=BCA%2BBadge\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter\" style=\"border: none !important; display: block !important; padding: 0 !important; margin: 0 !important;\" src=\"http:\/\/static.weddingwire.com\/static\/images\/badges\/BCA-2012\/BCA_2012-badge-bottom.png\" alt=\"2012 Bride's Choice Awards | Best Wedding Photographers, Wedding Dresses, Wedding Cakes, Wedding Florists, Wedding Planners\" border=\"0\" \/><\/a><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p>{Denver,CO} \u2013 January 23, 2012 \u2013 WeddingWire, the nation&#8217;s leading wedding Marketplace, is excited to announce JAMMIN&#8217; DJs &#8211; Georgia has been selected to receive the prestigious WeddingWire Bride\u2019s Choice Awards\u2122 2012 for DJ!<\/p>\n<p>The esteemed annual awards program recognizes the top local wedding vendors from the WeddingWire Network who demonstrate excellence in quality, service, responsiveness and professionalism within the wedding industry. While many industry awards are selected by the organization, JAMMIN&#8217; DJs &#8211; Georgia was selected based on its stellar reviews from past newlywed clients.<\/p>\n<p>JAMMIN&#8217; DJs &#8211; Georgia is recognized as part of the top five percent of wedding professionals in the WeddingWire local vendor community, comprised of over 200,000 wedding professionals throughout the United States and Canada. The Bride\u2019s Choice Award recognizes the best local wedding vendors across 20 service categories, from wedding venues to wedding photographers, based on their overall professional achievements throughout the past year.<\/p>\n<p>\u201cWeddingWire is thrilled to honor the success of the top-rated wedding professionals within the WeddingWire Community,\u201d said Timothy Chi, CEO, WeddingWire. \u201cSince the launch of the Bride\u2019s Choice Awards\u2122 program four years ago, thousands of outstanding wedding professionals have been recognized by the bridal community for their supreme service and dedication to the wedding industry. It is with great pleasure that we congratulate JAMMIN&#8217; DJs &#8211; Georgia for their continued professionalism and commitment to enriching the wedding planning experience for engaged couples.\u201d<\/p>\n<p>We are happy to announce that JAMMIN&#8217; DJs &#8211; Georgia is one of the very best DJs within the WeddingWire Network, which includes leading wedding planning sites WeddingWire, Project Wedding, Brides.com, Martha Stewart Weddings, and Weddingbee. We would like to thank our past clients for taking the time to review our business on WeddingWire. Thanks to their positive feedback we were able to receive the WeddingWire Bride\u2019s Choice Awards\u2122 for 2012.<\/p>\n<p>For more information, please visit our WeddingWire Storefront today at<a title=\"JAMMIN\" href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingwire.com\/biz\/jammin-djs-colorado-denver\/285ea0753099df68.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> http:\/\/www.weddingwire.com\/biz\/jammin-djs-colorado-denver\/285ea0753099df68.html<\/a>\u00a0. Or visit them online at: <a href=\"http:\/\/myjammindjs.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http:\/\/myjammindjs.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>To learn more about the Bride&#8217;s Choice Awards\u2122, please visit <a href=\"http:\/\/weddingwire.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">www.WeddingWire.com<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>{Denver,CO} \u2013 January 23, 2012 \u2013 WeddingWire, the nation&#8217;s leading wedding Marketplace, is excited to announce JAMMIN&#8217; DJs &#8211; Georgia has been selected to receive the prestigious WeddingWire Bride\u2019s Choice Awards\u2122 2012 for DJ! The esteemed annual awards program recognizes the top local wedding vendors from the WeddingWire Network who demonstrate excellence in quality, service,&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":1231,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[22],"tags":[27,92,93,99,104,177,179,186],"class_list":["post-1478","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-press-release","tag-1-colorado-wedding-dj","tag-denver-corporate-events","tag-denver-dj","tag-denvers-1-dj-service","tag-dj-service","tag-wedding-dj","tag-wedding-dj-denver","tag-www-myjammindjs-com"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.7 (Yoast SEO v26.7) - https:\/